e","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0009","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0222","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0244","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"蕭乂理（字季英，安樂侯），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-yili-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","quote":"通理弟乂理字季英，會理第六弟也。生十旬而簡王薨，至三歲而能言，見內人分散，涕泣相送，乂理問其故，或曰：「此簡王宮人，喪畢去爾。」乂理便號泣，悲不自勝，諸宮人見之，莫不傷感，爲之停者三人焉。服闋後，見高祖，又悲泣不自勝。高祖爲之流涕，謂左右曰：「此兒大必爲奇士。」大同八年，封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0020","source_term":"生十旬而簡王薨"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"承南康簡王子諸傳之嗣與諸子次第，乂理生十旬而簡王卒。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0118"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0118","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0118"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-liang029-yili-older-sister","subject_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CC","object_person_id":"elf_z5p_y5s","predicate":"sister","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其姊安固公主"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","quote":"太清中，侯景內寇，乂理聚賓客數百，輕裝赴南兗州，隨兄會理入援，恒親當矢石，爲士卒先。及城陷，又隨會理還廣陵，因入齊爲質，乞師。行二日，會侯景遣董紹先據廣陵，遂追會理，因爲所獲。紹先防之甚嚴，不得與兄弟相見，乃偽請先還京，得入辭母，謂其姊安固公主曰：「事旣如此，豈可闔家受斃。兄若至，願爲言之，善爲計自勉，勿賜以爲念也。家國阽危，雖死非恨，前途亦思立效，但未知天命何如耳！」至京師，以魏降人元貞立節忠正，可以託孤，乃以玉柄扇贈之。貞怪其故，不受。乂理曰：「後當見憶，幸勿推辭。」會祖皓起兵，乂理奔長蘆，收軍得千餘人。其左右有應賊者，因間劫會理，其衆遂駭散，爲景所害，時年二十一。元貞始悟其前言，往收葬焉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0009","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0118"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"是乂理之姊，南史亦載安固主。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0118","start":118,"end":122,"surface":"安固公主","kind":"person","person_id":"elf_z5p_y5s","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete